  "narration": "The cart track climbs out of Dubrslav through the sheep-walk and the rain thins to a cold mist. Five hours on, where the road dips toward Hollowbourne, a felled tree lies across it \u2014 cut, not fallen.\n\nA voice from the bracken: \"That's far enough. Purse on the stump, and walk on.\""
